an style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的方程为</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/81a2df231e7aab9d7838707d47c58a97.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，分布于椭圆方程联立，利用韦达定理求出</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/f6bce3d91ca23b86d8c6625f2632e437.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">两点的坐标，进而可求出</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/7a5f1641947153c80b987320885a2b57.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的方程，进而可得出答案</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">.</span></p></div><div class=\"qml-exps-sq\" id-container=\"question\">(1)小问详解： <p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">由椭圆</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/e67a71d168a890d9b2c46e3e05464969.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">得</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/22e5d2c4522a039f215cdfda4f4e20a8.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，所以</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/3d225bfed2e8f5b75396bf56a1a41307.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">所以</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/b2cfd997d3b66a3b8f7731b26f0ab0c8.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的周长为</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/566fb1be06b33be0c4bd11fe8543cc95.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">；</span></p></div><div class=\"qml-exps-sq\" id-container=\"question\">(2)小问详解： <p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">设</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/d6854807ee5753e057563fd727d6f781.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">由</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/c414fd36c26f4b41bb3a18a0c4a12dee.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，得</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/5cd587057767330a1d444a87e9465753.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">所以</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/9e69644761e054127b04b15f86c5b259.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，即</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/0832c846fc47da71b246f1f70acce60b.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">又因为</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/43b6ffaa50435ac95c10fe33974635bc.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，所以</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/7eaba1f3c94e56d6c0f4bfc387100993.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">解得</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/582ee38b51f09ab62f973b6cffa04d06.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">即点</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/acc290b44635265137fdf13146b6a6d9.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的横坐标的取值范围为</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/793db6a6bfa88a47e6857b1b316668d5.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">；</span></p></div><div class=\"qml-exps-sq\" id-container=\"question\">(3)小问详解： <p style=\"text-align: left;\"><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/24eea7eb004c56ee17e62e0b915136e9.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=