">联立</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/782f26a94229cb07e9f409743d428b07.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，消</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/d053b14c8588eee2acbbe44fc37a6886.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">得</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/949473dd2d741adaacdfe805c7e7baea.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">则</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/ed907cf5388771eb77e61c7451ba726b.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，所以</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/7090a76789bdebb171f58205dad88dd7.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，所以</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/36238a5b62bc73a00e1649fad375483b.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">故</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/ae588639ce34c959f291200ea06d0934.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">当</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/805d77a22499e265e904032427216dd5.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，即</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/5a5519bed1502d5096d0ac160f263b80.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/9f54f6008d900b4ce3f5f8b317d237ae.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">则直线</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/7a5f1641947153c80b987320885a2b57.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的方程为</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/a7364785baa88cb047b38b501edb3398.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">即</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/0bf735242101a0ea53952af2d7b7bb68.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，过定点</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/8dcf02e64b9374c513c6bf9c31ad3cf0.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">当</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/b0b3a949a439af88da929f38198cd063.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，即</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/af4f20e07026256fa17244ef48ea0897.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">此时</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/71c9acb29e8f92cce62c38510e7ae2e7.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，直线</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/7a5f1641947153c80b987320885a2b57.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">过定点</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/8dcf02e64b9374c513c6bf9c31ad3cf0.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">设</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/72274fde15fa4d0be764d29522507db0.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，因为</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/8cb1fd6343d673dcc4a1305c28ff180d.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">所以过点</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/8be80a55e4dc32de92fc59b6e59f7435.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">为坐标原点</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/04582116cd765fcc5a52f44279ad6c94.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">三点的圆即为过点</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/d80fb501c3b93affef40c693a8ee0d7f.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">为坐标原点</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/04582116cd765fcc5a52f44279ad6c94.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">三点的圆，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">因为</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/258c8593274249a95a671a5282504710.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">过原点，点</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/8dcf02e64b9374c513c6bf9c31ad3cf0.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，点</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/54647dd479017855db263a605b7453ec.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">所以过点</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/8be80a55e4dc32de92fc59b6e59f7435.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">为坐标原点</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/04582116cd765fcc5a52f44279ad6c94.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">三点的圆是定圆</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/fd8b3d09aa4eca0d55492b63f0c5524a.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><img  height=\"201\" src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/QBM/2025/4/9/3730335565561856/3730389030707200/EXPLANATION/5e3f4f23e7e84bf297dc427fae74bfc0.png\" width=\"310\" /></p></div></div>",
